>
  <div>
    <p>
      This page covers this website. Each project has its own privacy policy, linked from its page. The Hue of Year
      app's policy is <a href="/hue-of-year/privacy/">here</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing. There are no cookies, no analytics, no forms and no accounts. The fonts and images are served from this
      site, so your browser does not contact any other service while you read it.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. When you visit, GitHub may log technical data such as your IP address to run
      and secure its service. See
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>Links to the App Store or GitHub take you to their sites, where their own privacy policies apply.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
    <p>Manuel Ossanna, as a private person.</p>
  </div>
</Document>
